WEBVTT

00:07:58.428 --> 00:08:00.334
But what hurt the most

00:08:00.358 --> 00:08:02.517
was being put on the "Worst Dressed" list.

00:08:02.541 --> 00:08:05.751
(Laughter)

00:08:05.775 --> 00:08:08.106
It can be hard, being yourself,

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:09.903
but I've found it's the best way.

00:08:09.927 --> 00:08:11.284
There's the "Worst Dressed."

00:08:11.308 --> 00:08:12.854
(Laughs)

00:08:13.768 --> 00:08:16.371
As the quote goes,
"Everyone else is already taken."

00:08:17.128 --> 00:08:20.415
I've come to realize that confidence
is a concept you can choose.

00:08:20.991 --> 00:08:25.121
I've come to realize that authenticity
is necessary, and it's powerful.

00:08:26.206 --> 00:08:29.244
I've tried to spend time
being like other people.

00:08:29.741 --> 00:08:30.981
It didn't work.